  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the heart of Subchain City's raucous 'Bldg Stage Divers' district, Glitch grew up amidst the chaotic rhythm of decaying synths and desperate ducks clinging to dwindling DRIP. He scavenged discarded tech, learning to 'hack' anything he could get his flippers on, driven by a burning desire to bring back the 'good old days' he only heard about in fragmented broadcasts.",
    "class": "Cryo-Hacker",
    "name": "Glitch McQuack",
    "personality": "Rebellious and impulsive, Glitch is always looking for an angle. He's got a soft spot for the underdog, probably because he's been one his whole life. He masks his vulnerability with a snarky wit and a devil-may-care attitude, preferring the company of machines to most ducks.",
